[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: UAOP stakeholder needs
UID: UAOP-STK
VERSION: Issue 1
DATE: 2026-11-21
OPTIONS:
  MARKUP: Markdown

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: ../02-standards/requirements.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
What the people around the system need from it. Drawn from the ConOps (`conops.md`) and the personas in `docs/00_Project_Foundation/PRODUCT_REQUIREMENTS.md`. Not yet validated with stakeholders. System requirements (`system-requirements.sdoc`) trace up to these.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Remote pilot

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Truthful vehicle state
STATEMENT: >>>
The pilot needs the displayed vehicle state to be current and true, and needs old or simulated data to be shown as such.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 4.1, 4.3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-002
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Commands with a known outcome
STATEMENT: >>>
The pilot needs a command to reach the intended vehicle once, and to learn whether it was accepted, rejected or is unknown.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 4.1

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-003
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Failures made obvious
STATEMENT: >>>
The pilot needs loss of the vehicle link, or of a platform function, to be shown within seconds.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 4.2, 4.3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-004
STATUS: Active
TITLE: One station in control
STATEMENT: >>>
The pilot needs to know that only one authorised session can command the vehicle at a time, and that an emergency action is never blocked by that rule.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 3

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Safety and compliance officer

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-005
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Tamper-evident record
STATEMENT: >>>
The officer needs a complete record of every command, parameter change and flight in which any alteration can be detected.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 4.5

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-006
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Evidence checked offline
STATEMENT: >>>
The officer needs flight evidence that a third party can verify without a network, and that reports findings without stating that an aircraft may fly.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 4.5

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Operator and integrator

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-007
STATUS: Active
TITLE: No internet
STATEMENT: >>>
The operator needs every function to work with no internet connection.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 5

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-008
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Both autopilots, and beside another station
STATEMENT: >>>
The operator needs the same behaviour with PX4 and ArduPilot, and needs to run UAOP beside another control station without it being able to command.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-009
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Stable typed interfaces
STATEMENT: >>>
The integrator needs versioned, typed interfaces that do not break between releases.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 2

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-010
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Post-flight diagnosis that advises only
STATEMENT: >>>
The engineer needs a post-flight diagnosis of each log with recommendations, and needs every change to stay a human decision.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 3, 4.5

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Assessor

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STK-011
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Reviewable development
STATEMENT: >>>
The assessor needs to trace each behaviour to a requirement and a test, and needs the project to state plainly what is not built or not verified.
<<<
SOURCE: ConOps 2

[[/SECTION]]
